  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Mushroom Pot Pie.png|200px|left|Mushroom pot pie]]\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Products|Product]]\n |level = 97\n |price = 1 to 162\n |time = 1 h\n |source = {{Infoicon|pieo|bigger|link=Pie Oven}}\n |xp = 19\n |base = 45\n |time3 = 51 min\n |dia= 4\n}}\n'''Mushroom pot pie''' are [[products]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 97.\n\nLike all [[products]], they are stored in the [[barn]].\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Making mushroom pot pie'''===\n[[File:Pie Oven.png|150px|left|Pie Oven]]\nMushroom pot pies are made in the [[Pie Oven]].\n\nTo make a pie, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Mushroom.png|75px|link=Mushroom|Mushroom]]\n|[[File:Cabbage.png|75px|link=Cabbage|Cabbage]]\n|[[File:Wheat.png|75px|link=Wheat|Wheat]]\n|[[File:Egg.png|75px|link=Egg|Egg]]\n|-\n|'''x3'''\n|'''x3'''\n|'''x3'''\n|'''x2'''\n|}\nIt takes 1 hour to make a pie, and 51 minutes in a fully [[Masteries|mastered]] oven. Each pie gives players 19 [[experience]] points.\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Selling mushroom pot pies'''===\n[[File:Roadside Shop.png|150px|left|Roadside Shop]]\n* Mushroom pot pies can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 1,620 {{Infoicon|coin}} for 10 pies.\n* Buying the ingredients required to make a mushroom pot pie costs 129 {{Infoicon|coin}}.\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Boat orders'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|Riverboat]]\n* [[Boat]] orders require 1 to 4 mushroom pot pies per crate, up to a total of 12 per boat.\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Strategy tips'''===\n----\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Pilzpastete\n|es = Pastel de setas\n|fr = Soufflé aux Champignons\n|it = Pasticcio di funghi\n|nl = Paddenstoelenpastei\n|no = Sopp-pai\n|zh = Mushroom Pot Pie\n}}\n[[pt-br:Torta de cogumelos]]\n[[ru:Пирог с грибами]]\n\n[[Category:Pie Oven Products]]\n[[Category:Cabbage Products]]\n[[Category:Mushroom Products]]\n[[Category:Wheat Products]]\n[[Category:Egg Products]]",
